## LRC14 Unit-Excess Farey Payloads
Rows are p/q = p/(14p-1), so e=14p-q=1.
p= 1 q= 13 p+q= 14 pq=  13 digits(q^p)= 2 digits(p^q)=  1 route=AP/GW parent; Zeck(p+q)=[13, 1]; Zeck(pq)=[13]
p= 2 q= 27 p+q= 29 pq=  54 digits(q^p)= 3 digits(p^q)=  9 route=C27 petal/two-block; Zeck(p+q)=[21, 8]; Zeck(pq)=[34, 13, 5, 2]
p= 3 q= 41 p+q= 44 pq= 123 digits(q^p)= 5 digits(p^q)= 20 route=K33/state-lift/Fejer; Zeck(p+q)=[34, 8, 2]; Zeck(pq)=[89, 34]
p= 4 q= 55 p+q= 59 pq= 220 digits(q^p)= 7 digits(p^q)= 34 route=K33/state-lift/Fejer; Zeck(p+q)=[55, 3, 1]; Zeck(pq)=[144, 55, 21]
p= 5 q= 69 p+q= 74 pq= 345 digits(q^p)=10 digits(p^q)= 49 route=K33/state-lift/Fejer; Zeck(p+q)=[55, 13, 5, 1]; Zeck(pq)=[233, 89, 21, 2]
