p= 7 q= 97 p+q=104 pq= 679 digits(q^p)=14 digits(p^q)= 82 route=K33/state-lift/Fejer; Zeck(p+q)=[89, 13, 2]; Zeck(pq)=[610, 55, 13, 1]
